Third-party components
======================

No third-party bot framework (NoneBot / NcatBot / MaiBot / AstrBot / Koishi)
code is included or vendored. CatooBot talks to QQ through an external NapCat
deployment speaking OneBot 11, which you install and operate yourself. NapCat,
QQ, and every Python dependency listed in `pyproject.toml` keep their own
licenses and terms.
